{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16561","headline":"长歌行 · 刘复","name":"长歌行","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"淮南木落秋云飞，楚宫商歌今正悲。\n青春白日不与我，当垆举酒劝君持。\n出门驱驰四方事，徒用辛勤不得意。\n三山海底无见期，百龄世间莫虚弃。\n君不见金城帝业汉家有，东制诸侯欲长久。\n奸雄窃命风尘昏，函谷重关不能守。\n龙蛇出没经两朝，胡虏凭陵大道销。\n河水东流宫阙尽，五陵松柏自萧萧。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘复","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_16561.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16561","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}